# Local development needs no environment variables; it uses /api/aircraft.
# GitHub Pages builds without an API URL and offers the example dashboard.
# To enable live tracking on Pages, create .env.pages.local after deploying a real relay.
# Set VITE_AIRCRAFT_API_URL to that relay's verified HTTPS endpoint.
# Do not use a placeholder address or the GitHub Pages website URL.
# This address is public. Do not put secrets here.
# VITE_AIRCRAFT_API_URL=
